{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的感受行在部分短屏仍然过密，而且人物心理的因果链和前后衔接不如X左栏连续叙述得清楚。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的短句配合放大加亮的关键词，让观众边听边扫时更容易抓住每段的心理转折；部分感受随音乐到时出现，也让声音变化、身体感觉和情绪之间的联系更具体细腻，不必读完所有小字才有收获。X的优势是把人物为什么克制、为什么放开、为什么又想退缩讲得更完整，整条心理线也更连贯，但在有限秒数里，长句加右侧词组不容易同时吸收。综合实际能看进去的内容，Y略胜，但不是所有段落都胜。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c47c4bba-cef6-4728-a233-a94deb9c155b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T044321445594Z", "elapsed_seconds": 48.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T04:44:10.042203+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5a0bdce5e2614a7289dff71e57f5c9d74f28670d7258bce925669dc1b500efb9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachme